### get all

GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses
### get by ids
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/8

### get by name
GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/search?name=lega

### get active

GET  http://localhost:8080/api/courses/active
### create

POST  http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rust for Hacking Extreme",
    "description": "Rust programming language for hacking",
    "capacity":1,
    "active":true

}


###

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Java Basics",
    "description": "Java for begginers",
    "capacity":20,
    "active":true

}

